//! Pinned oracle signatures — the exact console behavior at the
//! time each row was recorded. Generated once from a run of the
//! corpus and then hand-owned: a row changes only when a change to
//! the console is *meant* to change what a user sees, and the diff
//! in the failure output is the review surface for that decision.
//!
//! Rows are positional — index N here answers input N in the
//! matching corpus in [`super::oracle_corpus`].

